#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# 默认按文本处理并统一为 LF：仓库在 Windows 与 Linux（CI）双端开发，
# 避免 CRLF 混入导致构建脚本、JSON、YAML 出现差异。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Linux start script should use lf
/gradlew        text eol=lf

# These are Windows script files and should use crlf
*.bat           text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.png           binary
*.jar           binary
